---
metadata:
  layer: documentation
  scope: docs/
  version: "1.0"
  description: Architecture, decisions, and execution records

template:
  required_files: [ARCHITECTURE.md, decisions.md]
  required_directories: [planning/]
  single_source_of_truth:
    - source: ARCHITECTURE.md
      for: Rust, bridge, and TypeScript boundaries
    - source: decisions.md
      for: decisions and rationale

agent_rules:
  update_order:
    - "Record a decision before changing architecture, protocol, or enforcement scope"
    - "Update stable architecture documentation"
    - "Update planning and status records"
  reference_policy:
    target_must_exist: true
    allow_external: false
    require_description: true
---

# Documentation conventions

Decisions are append-only; plans and status remain reality-based working docs.
